* ## Errors: a required <function>_*.m file missing from path='s own directory (here,
* accumulate.m itself is missing -- only accumulate_start.m exists in missing_output/) is
* rejected at construction time with OctBlockMissingRequiredFile, before octave-cli is even
* asked about it.
SRC kind=const value=3
G1 kind=octblock path=doc-verify/octblock/missing_output function=accumulate in=SRC
